<title>USA: Lawrence Cty, Tenn., won by NationsBanc of Tennessee. [CORRECTED 23:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Lawrence Cty, Tenn., won by NationsBanc of Tennessee. [CORRECTED 23:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to read that NationsBanc won the bonds, not First Tennessee Bank.)</p>
<p>NationsBanc of Tennessee said it won $4 million of Lawrence Cty, Tenn., school bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.89 percent (corrects from 5.2054 percent.)</p>
</text>
